{"id": "22-325-2-11", "zh": "Sadatthapasuto siyā（应当专注于自己的目标）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-326-2-4", "zh": "也替换为 ya：", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-327-2-18", "zh": "Sayaṃ raṭṭhaṃ hitvāna（亲自舍弃王国）；施予花朵的人叫 pupphadāniyo，即 pupphadāniko；住在 sippali 林中的人叫 sippalivaniyo，即 sippalivaniko；kumāriyā 即 kumārikā（少女）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-328-2-4", "zh": "kha 替换为 ga：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-329-2-4", "zh": "eḷamūgo（聋哑者）即 eḷamūkho。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-330-2-4", "zh": "ga 替换为 ka：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-331-2-17", "zh": "会毁坏，所以叫 loko（世间）；使人得到健康，所以叫 bhisakko（医生）；kulūpako 即 kulūpago（常往来于施主家的人），khīrūpako 即 khīrūpago，gīvūpakaṃ 即 gīvūpagaṃ（颈饰）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-332-2-4", "zh": "gha 替换为 ha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-333-2-4", "zh": "因为奔跑迅速，所以叫 sīho（狮子）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-334-2-4", "zh": "ca 替换为 cha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-335-2-11", "zh": "vinicchayo（抉择）、acchariyaṃ（稀有）、macchariyaṃ（悭吝）；raṃsiyo niccharanti（光芒放射出来），意思是向外发出。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-336-2-4", "zh": "cha 替换为 sa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-337-2-20", "zh": "Atthi sāhassa jīvitaṃ（他还有六天的寿命）——拆分为 chāhaṃ + assa；saḷāyatanaṃ（六处）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-338-2-4", "zh": "ja 替换为 da：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-339-2-8", "zh": "征服敌军，所以叫 passenadī（波斯匿）——依大规则省略元音，ra 同化为后面的辅音。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-340-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ya：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-341-2-11", "zh": "依靠而生，所以叫 niyo，或者叫 niyako；niyaṃ puttaṃ（亲生的儿子）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-342-2-4", "zh": "ña 替换为 ṇa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-343-2-7", "zh": "paṇṇatti 即 paññatti（施设），paṇṇāsaṃ 即 paññāsaṃ（五十）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-343-8-10", "zh": "paṇṇavīsati 即 pañcavīsati（二十五）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-344-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 na：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-345-2-22", "zh": "Nāmamattaṃ na nāyati（连名字也无人知晓），animittā na nāyare（无相者不为人所知）——意思是不被知晓。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-346-2-4", "zh": "ta 替换为 ka：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-347-2-4", "zh": "niyako 即 niyato（决定的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-348-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 tha：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-349-2-7", "zh": "nitthiṇṇo（已度过）、nittharaṇaṃ（度脱）、netthāraṃ（解脱）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-350-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 na：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-351-2-27", "zh": "jino（胜者）、pino、lino、paṭisallino（独处者）、paḷino、malino（污秽的）、supino（梦）、pahīno（已断除）、dhuno、puno、luno、āhunaṃ（供品）、pāhunaṃ（待客之物）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-352-2-4", "zh": "da 替换为 ḍa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-353-2-7", "zh": "chavaḍāho（焚烧尸体）、disāḍāho（四方燃烧）、kāyaḍāho（身体灼热）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-354-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ḷa：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-355-2-11", "zh": "pariḷāho（热恼）；人们来到这里焚烧尸体，所以叫 āḷahanaṃ，也就是墓地。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-356-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ta：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-357-2-11", "zh": "sugato（善逝）、tathāgato（如来）、kusito（懈怠者）；能生出（万物），所以叫 utu（季节）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-358-2-4", "zh": "dha 替换为 da：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-359-2-17", "zh": "Ekamidāhaṃ bhikkhave samayaṃ（比丘们，有一次我……）——或者说其中的 idha 是不变词。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-360-2-4", "zh": "也替换为 ha：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-361-2-29", "zh": "Sāhu dassanamariyānaṃ（见到圣者是好事），saṃhitaṃ、vihitaṃ、pihitaṃ、abhihitaṃ、sannihitaṃ、paṇihitaṃ、saddahati（相信）、vidahati、pidahati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-362-2-4", "zh": "na 替换为 ña：", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "22-363-2-17", "zh": "upaññāso 即 upanyāso（引述）；ñāyo 即 nyāyo——必定由它引出结果，所以叫 ñāyo（正理）；ñeyyaṃ 即 neyyaṃ（所知）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-364-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ya：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-365-2-13", "zh": "盗贼的行为叫 theyyaṃ（偷盗）；以长老为依，所以叫 therādheyyaṃ，也就是 pātimokkhaṃ（波罗提木叉）；parādheyyakaṃ dukkhaṃ（依赖他人的苦）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-366-2-4", "zh": "pa 替换为 pha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-367-2-7", "zh": "nipphajjati（成就）、nipphatti（成就）、nipphannaṃ（已成就的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-368-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ba：", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-369-2-21", "zh": "sambahulaṃ 即 sampahulaṃ（众多）；bahusanto na bharati（有能力却不供养）即 pahu santo na bharati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-370-2-4", "zh": "bha 替换为 pha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-371-2-13", "zh": "Anantaṃ sabbatopaphaṃ（无边无际、处处光明）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-372-2-4", "zh": "ma 替换为 pa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-373-2-19", "zh": "Cirappavāsiṃ（久别远行的人），hatthippabhinnaṃ（发情的大象）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-374-2-4", "zh": "ya 替换为 va：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-375-2-42", "zh": "dīghāvu kumāro 即 dīghāyu kumāro（长寿王子）；能维持寿命，所以叫 āvudhaṃ，即 āyudhaṃ（武器）；在“有寿命”的意义上，āvuso 是不变词；kasāvo 即 kasāyo（涩味），kāsāvaṃ 即 kāsāyaṃ（袈裟）；收割稻谷的人叫 sālilāyako（割稻人），还有 tiṇalāyako（割草人）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-376-2-5", "zh": "la 替换为 ra：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-377-2-18", "zh": "河水是青色的，所以叫 nerañjarā（尼连禅河）；容量足以盛水，所以叫 arañjaro（大水瓮）；sassataṃ pareti、ucchedaṃ pareti（趋向常见、趋向断见），意思是 paleti（趋向）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "22-378-2-4", "zh": "va 替换为 pa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-379-2-4", "zh": "pipāsati 即 pivāsati（口渴）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-380-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ba：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-381-2-36", "zh": "byākato（已解答）、byatto（博学的）、byañjanaṃ（文句）、sīlabbataṃ（戒禁）、nibbānaṃ（涅槃）、nibbutaṃ（寂灭）、dibbaṃ（天上的）、dibbati、sibbati（缝）、kubbati（做）、kubbanto、krubbati、krubbanto；因为不应亲近、应当回避，所以叫 bālo（愚人）；pabbajito（出家人）、pabbajjā（出家）等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-382-2-4", "zh": "sa 替换为 cha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-383-2-26", "zh": "ucchiṭṭhaṃ，意思是剩余的；在“dibbā saddā niccharanti, raṃsiyo niccharanti”（天上的声音传出，光芒放射）这里，也有人主张是 sa 替换为 cha。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-384-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 ta：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-385-2-23", "zh": "Uttiṭṭhapattaṃ upanāmenti（他们递上乞食的钵）；而在“uttiṭṭhe nappamajjeyya”（站在门前乞食时不应放逸）这里，uttiṭṭhaṃ 的意思是为了乞食而站立。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-385-24-46", "zh": "经中说：“圣者们为乞食而站立，这就是圣者的乞求。”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-386-2-4", "zh": "ha 替换为 gha：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-387-2-9", "zh": "在这个时节总是炎热灼烧，所以叫 nidāgho（夏季）；laghu 即 lahu（轻）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-388-2-4", "zh": "ḷa 替换为 ḍa：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-389-2-4", "zh": "garuḍo 即 garuḷo（金翅鸟）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-390-2-4", "zh": "以上是辅音替换部分。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-391-2-5", "zh": "下面讲混合替换。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-392-2-4", "zh": "ava 替换为 u：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-393-2-17", "zh": "uddhammo（非法）、ubbinayo（非律）、uppatho（邪道）、ummaggo（歧路）；uññā 即 avaññā（轻视），uññātaṃ 即 avaññātaṃ（被轻视的）；ujjhānasaññī（爱挑剔的人）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-394-2-3", "zh": "也替换为 o：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-395-2-10", "zh": "onaddho（被覆盖的）、okāso（空间）、ovādo（教诫）、olokanaṃ（观看）等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-396-2-4", "zh": "va 替换为 o：", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-397-2-34", "zh": "uposatho 是 upavasatho 的定形；nonītaṃ 即 navanītaṃ（新鲜酥油）；nivatthakoco 即 nivatthakavaco（披着铠甲的）；ko te balaṃ mahārāja, ko nu te rathamaṇḍalaṃ（大王，你的军队在哪里？你的战车阵又在哪里？）——ko 的意思是 kva（在哪里）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-397-35-58", "zh": "Ko te diṭṭho vā suto vā, vānaro dhammiko iti（你在哪里见过或听过守法的猴子？）；ko nume gotamasāvakā gatā（乔达摩的这些弟子去了哪里？）——拆分为 kva nu + ime；soṇṇaṃ 即 suvaṇṇaṃ（黄金）等等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-398-2-4", "zh": "ku 替换为 kru：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-399-2-4", "zh": "krubbati 即 kubbati（做）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-400-2-4", "zh": "tta 替换为 tra：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-401-2-61", "zh": "atrajo putto（亲生的儿子）、khetrajo putto（妻子所生的儿子）即 attajo、khettajo；gotrabhū（种姓者）、vatrabhū（帝释）、citraṃ、vicitraṃ 即 cittaṃ、vicittaṃ（彩色的、多彩的）；utrastamidaṃ cittaṃ（这颗心惊恐不安）、utrāsī palāyī（惊恐地逃跑）、yātrā ca me bhavissati（我的生活将得以维持）等等。", "confidence": 60}
